{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "L. Novak's engagement on the beacon project ended Friday. Mark the account inactive in access/contractors.yaml and get their VPN and SSO access revoked today so nothing stays open over the weekend. revoke.sh in the repo applies the revocation."}
